---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import NavBar from "../components/NavBar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Robinson Global Consultants LLC">
  <html lang="en">
    <head>
      <meta charset="UTF-8" />
      <title>About — Robinson Global Consultants LLC</title>
      <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
      <style>
        body {
          margin: 0;
          font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
          background: #f7f9fc;
          color: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .section {
          max-width: 1100px;
          margin: 3rem auto;
          padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .section h1 {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
          margin-bottom: 1rem;
          color: #0a1a2b;
        }

        .card {
          background: white;
          padding: 2rem;
          border-radius: 8px;
          box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
          line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .card h2 {
          margin-top: 2rem;
          color: #0a1a2b;
        }

        .card p {
          margin: 0.8rem 0;
        }
      </style>
    </head>

    <body>
      <NavBar />

      <div class="section">
        <h1>About Robinson Global Consultants LLC</h1>

        <div class="card">
          <p>
            Robinson Global Consultants LLC is a Metro Atlanta–based security and risk
            management consulting firm built on decades of operational leadership across
            military, federal, and international environments. Our mission is to help
            organizations strengthen their security posture, elevate operational readiness,
            and build disciplined, accountable teams.
          </p>

          <p>
            We believe that strong organizations are built on readiness, accountability,
            and clear operational direction. Our consulting approach emphasizes proactive
            risk mitigation, disciplined leadership, and practical solutions that work in
            real-world environments.
          </p>

          <p>
            Whether supporting corporate security teams, government agencies, or
            international operations, we deliver strategies that enhance safety, strengthen
            processes, and empower leaders to perform at their highest level.
          </p>

          <h2>Leadership & Experience</h2>
          <p>
            Robinson Global Consultants LLC was founded by <strong>DeJuan Robinson</strong>, a
            seasoned security and operations professional with more than three decades of
            combined experience in federal law enforcement, diplomatic security, military
            service, and organizational leadership.
          </p>

          <p>
            DeJuan’s career began in the <strong>United States Marine Corps (1991–1995)</strong>,
            where he developed the discipline, mission focus, and operational mindset that
            continue to guide his work today. His professional journey includes leadership and
            security roles within:
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li><strong>U.S. Department of State — Diplomatic Security Service (DSS)</strong></li>
            <li><strong>U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE)</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Local law enforcement and municipal security operations</strong></li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            His assignments have included international missions, high‑risk protective
            operations, investigative work, physical security management, and leadership roles
            supporting federal, corporate, and global security environments.
          </p>

          <h2>Our Approach</h2>
          <p>
            We bring a disciplined, mission‑focused perspective to every engagement. Our work
            blends tactical experience with executive‑level insight, helping organizations
            operate with clarity, confidence, and resilience.
          </p>

          <p>
            Our expertise includes:
          </p>

          <ul>
            <li>Security assessments and risk analysis</li>
            <li>Operational readiness and crisis planning</li>
            <li>Protective operations and threat mitigation</li>
            <li>Physical security systems (CCTV, access control, alarms)</li>
            <li>Leadership development and organizational discipline</li>
            <li>Corporate and government security program management</li>
          </ul>

          <p>
            Every engagement is built on integrity, professionalism, and measurable results.
            Our goal is simple: to make organizations stronger, safer, and more prepared for
            what comes next.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <Footer />
    </body>
  </html>
</BaseLayout>
